WEBVTT

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.950
Where am I?

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.080
Odin...

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:48.910
Come, Claudia.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:22.370
A dream?

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:28.160
I...

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:33.410
Immovable Mind

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:04.760
Episode 11:
Reattacking Fuji Pillar!

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:26.740
--Good luck!
--Do your best!

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:41.950
It's all thanks to Major General Okita
that we recovered so quickly.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:43.110
Front-line Base
(Yokosuka Naval Base)

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:45.240
His immediate order to retreat paid off.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:49.790
We owe it to help from
our allies and rear forces too.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:52.660
For that, we can credit Helmwige...

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:56.200
Yayoi Amatsuka, and those who fought with her.

00:05:56.200 --> 00:06:01.990
Yet again, we're throwing the
whole world's strength into another plan.

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:08.540
A second offensive--one we'll be unable
to recover from. In other words...

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:13.330
If we lose this battle, humanity is defeated.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:17.450
But, we're not the only ones
whose wounds haven't healed.

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:19.790
Right, Odin?

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:24.740
It's about to begin, Odin...

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:28.080
This Ragnarök you've hoped for.

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:32.790
Kurumi, try not to be anxious.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:36.740
Yeah, I know. But, Moe...

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:40.040
There's nothing to worry about, girls!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:43.450
Just leave it to us old fogies!

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:50.990
I appreciate the thought,
but aren't you all retired?

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:55.790
As long as we've got our wings,
we'll be pilots for life!

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:58.830
You're young enough to be our granddaughters!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:01.450
We can't sit around while you fly!

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:07.160
Never thought I'd be this happy to fly
with my comrades into battle again!

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:12.740
And I never thought I'd be
this excited on a day I could die!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.830
You can't die!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.040
Huh?

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:21.870
We're Valkyries who fight
for the sake of the living!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:26.830
Yeah. Besides, we'll need
your help in the days to come.

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:31.080
Once the fighting's over, we'll put you to work.

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:36.490
You hearing these girls?!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:39.330
--They're scarier than my wife!
--Ain't that the truth!
--You know it!

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:42.490
You gonna work us geezers into the ground?

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:46.540
You'd give my wife a run for her money!

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:47.870
Mm-hmm!

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:54.950
We're gonna teach Odin that nothing's
scarier than the wife and grandkids!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.290
Right!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.620
Back here again, huh?

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.410
Commander.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.080
Hmm?

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:12.450
We drew the short end of the stick.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.680
How rude.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.830
You're killing the vibe.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:19.910
Whether you like it or not,
this is your workplace.

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:23.200
And everyone here is your army.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:27.080
Good grief. You guys used to be innocent.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.540
You taught us well.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.870
Ditto.

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:31.990
What she said.

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:35.040
How's the prep?

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:37.410
It's progressing smoothly.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:43.950
Ladies and Gentlemen, this is Commander Satomi.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:46.620
Sorry, but I'm bad at speeches.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:52.240
I probably can't inspire you,
but there's one thing I want to say:

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:56.200
Let's put an end to the defeats, starting today.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:59.830
We all returned here seeking victory.

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:59.830
"No Open Flames"

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:02.540
So, let's go and take it.

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:08.290
That crook of a god has earned our anger,
so let's give 'em a taste of it.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:12.290
Their history ended once. Let's make it twice.

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:16.910
That's the Ragnarök <i>we're</i> hoping for.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:19.540
Yeah!

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:23.700
He actually gave a speech.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:27.160
What's more, a first-class one at that.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:30.330
It sure was! I'm pumped up!

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:32.740
Must be nice to be carefree.

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:36.870
Azu, are you nervous?

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:42.990
Don't worry! Don't worry!

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:45.080
Don't worry!

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:52.830
Isn't it beautiful, Claudia?

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:54.660
This is...

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:58.490
My birthplace... and yours.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.540
I don't recognize it.

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:04.830
I know. I just wanted to say it.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.290
But, isn't it nice?

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:12.790
Odin... Your birthplace has long been destroyed.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:16.580
I know you've realized it by now.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:22.200
But that song survived.
It's a song telling of demise and revival.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:25.370
Many will end up dying.

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:30.790
Or, don't you believe what
this crook of a god has to say?

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:33.540
If you withdraw your spear, we don't have to--

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:39.990
Don't waste your breath. I'm trying
to make as many dead warriors as possible.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:43.200
For the coming Ragnarök.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:48.240
Dead warriors! My Einherjar!
Fall under my command!

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:55.080
I will triumph! I will win Ragnarök! Join me!

00:10:55.080 --> 00:11:01.740
You won't negotiate?
Then, why did you appear before me?

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:04.790
To follow up on your dream.

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:07.290
Come, Claudia.

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:09.330
My daughter.

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:12.200
My hand, I offer only to you.

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:14.120
I will not take your hand!

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:18.740
I have a father. I have a home in my heart.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:23.450
This is a god's utopia--a
fallen kingdom of dreams!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:29.910
You know nothing of
my greatness, foolish daughter!

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:33.490
You're an insolent Valkyrie
who defies their father!

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:37.200
My beloved daughter...

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:41.990
Then, I shall steal your life
and trap you in my kingdom!

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:50.330
Showing no mercy. That's my girl.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.450
Odin!

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:56.330
I will not run. I'm waiting in Fuji.

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:58.790
Come to me, Claudia.

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:01.870
Claudy?

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.330
Relax! Relax!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.240
Let's do our best!

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:10.990
Yeah, of course!

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:14.120
Sigururi.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:17.080
One, two...!

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:18.450
Sigururi!

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:27.370
Units fully deployed. Commander?

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:33.200
Commence operation "Ragnarök 2."

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:45.910
The battle started, huh?

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:52.290
Yeah. Just like last time,
it began with Sveið's bomb just as planned.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:56.580
But we have fewer Valkyries than before, right?

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:59.790
Yeah, it's true. Far fewer.

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:05.410
If Fuji Pillar is attacked, Secondaries
around the world will go active.

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:10.040
That's how the whole world
got thrashed on the last attempt.

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:13.910
This time, countries have Valkyries on defense.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:20.540
Most of Japan's forces are here fighting today.
And we're on standby.

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:25.830
Miko, I know how you feel, but...

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:29.870
It's all right. We're the trump card, right?

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:35.450
It's Azu's strategy, and
I trust her from head to toe.

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:39.290
You two never change.

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:44.040
That's a good attitude to have. The question is:

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:48.620
How long can they last without us--their aces?

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:53.450
Preserving the Valkyrie Wing...

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:58.160
At a minimum, until Point 1. Hopefully, Point 2.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:02.200
It'd be remarkable if we made it to Point 3.

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:05.910
Secondaries appearing within the Pillar!

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:08.490
Squadron 901 has engaged!

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:12.740
Type C: Cannon Type--the
same encountered at Umihotaru.

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:16.370
Take your reoccurring bosses elsewhere!

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:22.540
Secondary disabled! Point 1 has been reached!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:28.620
There's no way this is all you've got, Odin.

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:35.910
I thought most of their Named left,
but that clumsy Sveið stayed behind?

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:38.290
What a clever bunch.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:43.330
Claudia's not fighting?
Saving her for later is a daring plan.

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:47.040
However, how long can they last for?

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:56.080
Point 3 has been reached!
Enemy numbers quickly increasing!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:15:01.080
Hear that, Kurumi? Point 3! We've done enough!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.330
Let's keep it up, Moe!

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.700
Cross that and it's Point 4!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:10.490
At least, Point 1. If possible, Point 2.

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:13.290
Point 3 is remarkable. And then...

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:15.910
The miraculous Point 4!

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:23.290
It's a one-in-a-million gamble,
but do you think we can pull it off?

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:26.740
One in a million means it's gotta happen once!

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:30.950
We know the enemy,
but our munitions are minimal.

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:35.700
For humanity to win, we need a miracle.

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.200
So be it!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:40.370
I'll lead! Everyone, follow me!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.370
Hell yeah!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:44.540
That's risky!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.660
Guess we'll find out!

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:50.870
Woo!

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:54.540
We can't take 'em out, but we can toy with 'em!

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:56.830
These slowpokes are nothing!

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:58.950
Go on, girls!

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.290
Roger!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.160
Kurumi! Let's do it!

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:03.620
Got it!

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.240
Now!

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.490
Yippee!

00:16:26.490 --> 00:16:28.040
You're kidding!

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:34.200
Scary! Scary! Scary! Scary!

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:36.830
Leave it to us!

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:38.080
Huh?!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.240
That's--!

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:56.370
Is that Tateyama's Valkyrie Wing?

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.790
You know it! They're our idols!

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:01.160
They're different from the rest!

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:06.660
They're so kind that they'll forgive us,
no matter how dirty our thoughts are!

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:08.790
We're still disgusted though!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:12.080
Point 4... It's the best possible start.

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:15.240
But the sacrifice to get here was great.

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:17.450
We've gotta do our part!

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:21.990
Let's start by showing off
a little bit of teamwork!

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:23.620
I'll countdown!

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:25.410
Roger!

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:33.830
Three! Two! One! Now!

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:40.540
Those guys are incredible!

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.620
You did well, you two!

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:45.910
Fall back and leave the rest to us.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.330
Sonoka!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:51.080
It's okay! I'm a tough cookie!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:54.410
Counting on you!

00:17:58.240 --> 00:18:00.240
Sono's so cool!

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:05.160
You think? I've gotta show off
more of my cool side then!

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:07.240
Hah! Way to brag.

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:09.740
But it's very reassuring.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:11.990
Command?

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:14.120
Command. How's visibility?

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.330
It's good.

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:18.290
The Vandrande is blocked by enemies.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:20.910
We'll have to disperse 'em, slip in...

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:23.950
Yell "Fire!" and go boom!

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:28.200
Go! Go! Go! Don't fall behind!

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:30.580
Don't let the girls get ahead!

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:34.120
There's a reward waiting for whoever does best!

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:36.910
Guys just love to show off!

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:41.200
All the guys I know stink at showing off!

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:42.660
Thank goodness.

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:44.540
No comment.

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:51.540
Command! Thor has awoken!

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:59.540
Now then... Time to unleash
overwhelming numbers again.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.790
How will you handle <i>this</i> ?

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:07.160
What?

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:12.540
Primary Pillars have gone active!
Battle has begun worldwide!

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:17.950
Secondaries across the
country are closing in to reinforce!

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:22.540
The same situation as last time. However...

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:25.950
Secondaries across Japan have been engaged!

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:29.290
C'mon, c'mon, c'mon! What's the matter?!

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:32.540
Can'tcha catch a weak little girl?!

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:37.370
Even if we can't fight together,
we're still under the same sky!

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:40.160
I won't let you anywhere near Claudia!

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:45.990
Don't think we'll let you push us
around forever, you deranged god.

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:51.330
All countries. All forces.
All of humanity rests on this fight.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:54.740
Behold! This is our full potential!

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:59.200
The twilight of gods, Ragnarök, is at hand!

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:03.950
Rossweisse and others are fighting across Japan!

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:06.620
Pillar reinforcements have been halted!

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:08.370
Lizbet!

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:11.160
I've gotta step up my game too!

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:15.660
Let's not waste any time.
Wipe 'em out in one pass!

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:19.200
Coming through!

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:23.990
Miyako!

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:27.620
Hero Cannon, fire!

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:33.080
It missed?

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.040
No!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:37.240
Was it blocked?

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:39.240
Black Valkyries...

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:43.450
Svartr Valkyries...

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:47.160
Sakura...

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:48.740
Leyli...

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:51.450
I figured they'd show up.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:56.580
He's been making such
predictable moves; it's almost boring me.

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:59.910
Gee. Am I better at strategy than a god?

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:03.660
Totally! 'Cuz my Azu's a genius!

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:06.700
You two are just too much.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.910
But she's right.

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:14.830
This isn't nearly enough to break us, Odin!

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:18.200
Obviously. However...

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:21.660
Is this enough to shatter your hopes?!

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:27.410
Everyone, evade!

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:44.410
Command!

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.370
We're fine. It missed.

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:47.950
Oh?

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:53.120
It seems your base was well placed this time.

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:57.450
Of course it was. I was in charge of strategy.

00:21:57.450 --> 00:22:00.620
One clever move after another.

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:06.410
Your neurotic-level planning
has been truly splendid.

00:22:06.410 --> 00:22:08.740
But it all ends now.

00:22:20.660 --> 00:22:25.490
Dread your destruction. Fear the power of god.

00:22:25.490 --> 00:22:28.450
You shall know helplessness.

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:31.200
The coming of Ragnarök is nigh!

00:23:57.870 --> 00:23:59.540
Welcome party to fireworks!

00:23:59.540 --> 00:24:00.950
Now we've got Claudy!

00:24:00.950 --> 00:24:02.200
We're lucky dudes!

00:24:02.200 --> 00:24:03.040
Lots happened!

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:03.830
A lot did!

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:05.040
And even more will!

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:06.200
Yeah! So...!

00:24:06.200 --> 00:24:06.950
For tomorrow!

00:24:06.950 --> 00:24:08.620
For our Valkyries!

00:24:08.620 --> 00:24:09.990
Let's do this! Ragnarök!

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:12.050
Next Time

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:12.050
Final Episode

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:12.080
Let's do this! Ragnarök!
